  description: Hand approaches up to 5 mm closer around finger closure, smoothly
    constrained by a 1 mm sampled clearance margin. Existing finger curl is preserved
    because extending it increased contact penetration. Smooth overhead strap grasp
    based on the time-reversed release, with the final approach distributed across
    0.6 seconds. Lightly curved fingers, inward palm, gradual synchronized arm and
    finger motion. A smooth outward clearance correction keeps the hand surface outside
    the bottom grip while wrapping around it. Eight-second full sequence at 60 fps.
